WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.608
These are the main habits from Module 9 Profile
before cleaning

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:13.209
Preserve uncertainty rather than inventing
corrections Keep standardization

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:19.597
validation duplicate handling and correction
conceptually separate Use

00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:26.892
views quarantine patterns transactions and lineage
to make work safer and reproducible Add

00:00:26.905 --> 00:00:32.726
constraints after the rules are stable And keep
quality dimensions visible

00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:35.265
instead of hiding everything behind one score
